  introLines:
  - Greetings! Welcome to the tutorial!
  - Use W A S D to fly your ship.
  - Press Enter to continue.
  shootLines:
  - An asteroid is coming!
  - Aim with your eyes.
  - Blink with your eyes OR press SPACE to shoot.
  evadeLines:
  - Astroids cannot be destroyed.
  - 'Dodge the astroid instead. '
